d) Self-hosting the server code without an Enterprise / OEM license.

4. PLANS AND PAYMENTS
Paid plans are subscription-based (monthly/annual) plus an optional
marketplace fee on sales. Non-payment suspends Pro/Team features after a
14-day grace period; repos stay exportable for 90 days (git/archive export),
then inactive free accounts may be deleted with 30 days notice.

5. USER CONTENT
Skills/repos uploaded, imported, or created by users remain their property.
Users grant the Licensor a worldwide, non-exclusive, revocable license to
