Aggregate liability cap: amounts paid in the last 12 months, or EUR 100
for free plans.

7. SECURITY AND PRIVACY
Data processing is described in PRIVACY_POLICY.md (GDPR).
Passwords: scrypt + salt; JWT HS256 7-day expiry; single-use 30-minute reset
tokens. The Licensor applies appropriate security measures, but users are
responsible for strong credentials and secret rotation.

8. TERM AND TERMINATION
License is valid while the subscription is active and the Terms are met.
