HOW TO ADOPT THIS LICENSE
1. Fill in the [PLACEHOLDERS] above.
2. Copy this file as LICENSE in the project root.
3. Add to package.json: "license": "SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE".
4. Add a header to relevant source files:
   "© [YEAR] [HOLDER] — All rights reserved. See LICENSE."
5. If you later want to open-source the core: consider dual licensing
   (Community AGPL + Commercial) instead of pure MIT, so competing SaaS
   cannot reuse your code for free.
